CONCLUSION. Phase 3 is unmeasured by this suite, and the walltime rise
is NOT the plan anchor - it cannot be, because the anchor never fired on a
single case. Walltime across five runs of the same suite: 1585, 1415, 895,
972, 1320s. That is variance.

The real finding is about the SUITE. All 12 cases are single-step, one-line
prompts. Everything built this session for multi-step work and degenerate
behaviour - the plan anchor, the read-loop guard, greeting regression,
trust decay, the third exit - is invisible to it by construction. The only
thing it could measure was a missing tool, and it did: rename 0/3 -> 3/3.
